<title>USA: W.R. Berkley Corp Q1 revs, net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>W.R. Berkley Corp Q1 revs, net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.35		    $0.78</p>
<p> Net		 26,427		   15,684</p>
<p> Revs		329,822		  288,274</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,641		   20,178</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 Q1 operating income, or income before realized investment gains, increased to $20.4 million, or $1.04 a share, up from $15.5 million, or $0.77 a share in the 1996 quarter.</p>
</text>
